Online services used at runtime (not bundled here)
---------------------------------------------------
  The player renders the avatar live and depends on the VLibras online
  services for text->gloss translation and the sign dictionary. These are
  reached over HTTPS at runtime and are NOT part of this redistribution:
    * Translation: https://traducao2.vlibras.gov.br/translate
    * Dictionary:  https://dicionario2.vlibras.gov.br/2018.3.1/WEBGL/
                   https://dicionario2.vlibras.gov.br/static/BUNDLES/2018.3.1/WEBGL/
  These endpoints are the defaults compiled into the upstream src/config.js of
  this version. Only cue text is sent to the translation service.

Scope / boundaries
------------------
  This app uses ONLY the official vlibras-player-webjs component loaded in a
  WebView, per its documentation and LGPLv3. It does NOT automate the hosted
  "VLibras Vídeo" service, and does NOT embed the VLibras Widget or the
  Hand Talk Plugin.

